# Response headers for the Cloudflare Worker's static assets. wrangler parses
# this file out of the assets directory and the asset router applies the rules.
#
# Workers Static Assets adds neither of the two security headers below on its
# own (Cloudflare Pages did), so they are declared here. `nosniff` is the one
# that matters: without it a browser may disregard a declared Content-Type and
# sniff the bytes instead.

/_expo/static/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
